hawkeye and one division probably some  of the best marvel storytelling we've  gotten in quite a long time but the real  question is which one's better in case  you haven't read the video's title or  seen the thumbnail then you'll be  shocked to hear that in my opinion  hawkeye is the best marvel disney plus  series beating out wand division and all  the other shows welcome back to  streaming the galaxy i'm rocket riley  and in april of 2019 marvel announced  their slew of upcoming tv shows coming  to disney plus and i think we were all  expecting more low quality low budget  shows similar to agents of shield or the  netflix marvel series which are still  pretty great when things kicked off with  one division though everyone was  astounded at how absolutely amazing  everything looked and by the great  quality of the show the writing  production quality and big budgets  continued through loki and falcon in the  winter soldier it seemed as if all the  disney plus marvel series were gonna be  good if not great just like one division  then we got hawkeye and it just blew me  away by the way spoiler warning if you  haven't seen hawkeye or wandavision now  let's dive into all the things that were  similarly great on both shows first of  all i just want to applaud the writers  of both series for their ability to make  us truly care about all the new  characters added to the shows as well as  deepening our understanding of already  well-established characters for instance  wandavision made us actually care about  wanda's kids and their struggles and it  pulled everyone deep into an ago of the  heartless craze and hawkeye made us care  about one of my favorite new characters  kate bishop they do a great job of  setting up all the new characters  motivations as well as why we should  care about them also the writers were  able to take more time with wanda and  hawkeye to further develop their  characters since neither of them had  gotten much screen time before their  respective shows next i think it goes  without saying that both series have an  amazing production quality rivaling even  billion dollar films like avengers and  spider-man in behind the scenes  documentaries you can tell that these  disney plus projects take the same or  more time and effort to create than big  box office releases both wandavision and  hawkeye also bring us completely new and  unique concepts we've never seen before  one division takes us on a journey  through time from the view of a sitcom  audience while still telling a  spectacular story hawkeye puts a lesser  known character into a jingle bells and  grinchfield christmas series while also  pulling in characters from the greater  mcu such as yelena belova and even  kingpin also real quick i just want to  mention how excited i am to see how the  netflix shows are slowly getting wrapped  into the canon mcu projects as we saw  two characters show up in the mcu  recently matt murdock daredevil appeared  in spider-man no way home acting as  peter's legal counsel and wilson fisk  appeared in hawkeye as the menacing  character kingpin this just goes to show  that the mcu is going to be expanding in  ways that we might not have imagined  before okay now back to the main topic  of the video both shows have a  relatively consistent feel-good tone  throughout and i definitely appreciate  an upbeat story lastly both hawkeye and  wondervision had amazing twist villains  one division lulled us into a sense of  1950s and 60s security in the first few  episodes but then dropped on us that  wanda may actually be the villain of the  show since she trapped thousands of  people in a mystical hex in her grief  then we learned that wanda's neighbor  agnes is actually an even bigger villain  and it throws us for a complete  curveball hawkeye on the other hand  leads us to believe that jack duquesne  is the villain in the first few episodes  of the series but then we learned that  kate's mother eleanor is the real  villain killing armand and working  alongside wilson fisk's kingpin the  entire time now here's where things  start to differ between the two series  first of all i'm a huge sucker for  christmas stories so hawkeye gets a  point in my book right off the bat also  hawkeye adds in another character who's  been mostly separate from the greater  mcu up until this point ekko who's set  to get her own series in 2023 was really  great well one division introduced us to  several new characters it didn't do so  in the same way that echo was introduced  to us showing us her complete backstory  motivations and a full character arc  another big difference between the two  shows is that hawkeye completely  diverges from the typical marvel formula  especially in the finale most mcu films  and series like to end the story with a  big cgi filled battle and try to hint at  future projects before quickly tying up  any loose ends one division for example  had a big cgi filled battle between  wanda and agatha in between vision and  white vision they hinted at both the  upcoming film doctor strange and the  multiverse of madness and the series  agatha house of heartness then they  quickly wrapped up all loose ends  hawkeye however deviates from this  formula giving us a much greater  character-driven third act to the series  while hawkeye also has a big fight scene  at the end it doesn't rely too heavily  on cgi and it actually carries some  weight bringing clint and kate together  as hawkeye partners also the finale  doesn't have any overt hints at future  projects which seem kind of like a money  grab to me lastly hawkeye just does a  better job of focusing on character wand  division while it may have had a more  unique story than hawkeye falls flat in  the area of character in the third act  focusing more on continuing wanda's  story in future projects rather than on  finishing up complete character arc like  we saw in hawkeye overall though both  hawkeye and wand division are some of  the best marvel stories we've seen in a  long time hawkeye barely beats out wand  division on just a couple of points  which actually make a pretty significant  difference in the show's finished  quality if you were looking for a  complete recap of the hawkeye timeline  after watching the show then check out  this video also don't forget to  subscribe and like this video and from  everyone here at stream in the galaxy  thanks for watching  [Music]
 

